# Build context hygiene: docker build sends the whole repo as context, but the
# image only ever COPYs pyproject.toml and uv.lock. Excluding the rest shrinks
# the transfer (especially .git, which grows with every stamp commit) and
# prevents a stray large file from ballooning the context.
.git
.github
tests
README.md
LICENSE
.gitignore
.gitattributes
AGENTS.md